        <Comment>
            &lt;s val=&quot;AB_Description&quot;&gt;
            The Trium Coalition--an uneasy alliance between the Imperium, the Tau, and the ancient Necrons--stands victorious in the wake of the Tyranid&apos;s annihilation.
            The Hive Fleets are shattered, their threat to the galaxy extinguished,
            but the unity that defeated them is fragile.
            Beneath the surface, distrust simmers between former enemies,
            each faction wary of the others&apos; true intentions.
            &lt;/s&gt;
        </Comment>
