    <Element Type="Comment" Id="D51E6CCD">
        <Comment>
            &lt;s val=&quot;AB_Description&quot;&gt;
            &lt;c val=&quot;F4FA29&quot;&gt;
            The Trium Coalition--an alliance of disperate alliances has emerged victorious.
            Together, they have eradicated the Tyranid menace, driving the Hive Fleets from every corner of the galaxy.
            The once-devastating swarm that threatened all life is no more, its fleets shattered, and its vast hunger silenced.
            With the galaxy freed from the Tyranid scourge, the Coalition now turns its efforts toward rebuilding and uniting the fractured galaxy.
            From the ashes of war, a new order emerges--one of cooperation, strength, and unity.
            The Trium Coalition, forged in the fires of battle, now oversees a new era, securing peace and prosperity across the stars for all.
            &lt;/c&gt;
            &lt;/s&gt;
        </Comment>
        <SubFunctionType Type="SubFuncType" Library="Ntve" Id="00000004"/>
