    <Element Type="Comment" Id="339F6C28">
        <Comment>
            &lt;s val=&quot;AB_Description&quot;&gt;
            With the Dark King ascended and his power at their command, the High Lords of Terra have conquered the galaxy, leaving no resistance standing.
            Under the rule of the god of Ruin, the Imperium has become an unrelenting force of entropy, where all things--worlds, civilizations, and empires--are consumed by the inevitable decay of his influence.
