    <Element Type="Comment" Id="44DDD369">
        <Comment>
            &lt;s val=&quot;AB_Description&quot;&gt;
            The galaxy has fallen--not to war, but to curation. With subtle manipulations, ancient secrets, and the quiet removal of obstacles, Trazyn the Infinite has emerged not only as the master of the Necron dynasties, but as the undisputed ruler of the stars.
            Worlds are catalogued. Civilizations archived. History--corrected.
            No more reckless wars. No more self-destructive empires. Under Trazyn&apos;s rule, the galaxy is finally safe--from chaos, from decay, from change itself. Every notable figure is preserved. Every culture is contained.
            And he is very, very proud of the arrangement.
            From Solemnace, the Infinite Archive grows ever larger--an eternal monument to what was, overseen by the one being who truly appreciates it all.
            The galaxy endures--not in glory, but in glass.
            &lt;/s&gt;
        </Comment>
