            &lt;s val=&quot;AB_Description&quot;&gt;
            Jormungandr moved in silence, creeping through the stars, beneath the crusts of worlds, and through the shadows of civilization. Its vast subterranean swarm, ever patient, ever stealthy, struck from unseen depths--devouring in secret.
            The other Hive Fleets fell, not through confrontation, but by quiet assimilation.
            Kraken&apos;s hunger, Leviathan&apos;s size, even the grand armies of both, could not match Jormungandr&apos;s subtlety. Fleet after fleet, including its own kin, was consumed--Kraken&apos;s ferocity, Leviathan&apos;s mass, and Jormungandr&apos;s patience.
            &lt;/s&gt;
        </Comment>
