    <Element Type="Comment" Id="EB95B559">
        <Comment>
            &lt;s val=&quot;AB_Description&quot;&gt;
            The galaxy stands reshaped. The Imperium of Man has been eradicated, its once-great empire destroyed. 
            Chaos has been purged from the stars, its malignant influence extinguished. The Tyranid threat has been eradicated, their endless hunger silenced.
            The Tau Empire now spans across vast stretches of space, its ideals of unity and progress bringing order and advancement wherever they reach.
            The Necron dynasties, with their cold and ancient might, impose an unyielding order over their territories, their technological supremacy ensuring an eternal reign.
            Gone are the days of endless conflict and division. The galaxy is now an age of stability, shaped by the relentless pursuit of order and the unyielding force of those who now command its future.
            &lt;/s&gt;
        </Comment>
