    <Element Type="Comment" Id="26FFFCCE">
        <Comment>
            &lt;s val=&quot;AB_Description&quot;&gt;
            The galaxy stands united, yet ruled by two indomitable forces. The Imperium of Man, once fractured and on the brink of collapse, has been restored through sheer strength and unwavering resolve. 
            The Necrons, wielding their ancient might and technological supremacy, have ensured their dominion over the galaxy. Chaos has been eradicated, the Tyranid swarm silenced, and the Tau Empire destroyed.
            The Imperium, now under the guidance of its most capable leaders, has been restructured, purging bureaucratic stagnation in favor of military discipline and efficiency. 
            With renewed strength, it rebuilds its empire, its reach vast, its forces unrelenting in their pursuit of order.
            Meanwhile, the Necron dynasties assert their cold, unyielding rule, spreading their technological mastery across their territories. Their ageless reign brings eternal order, but devoid of warmth or compassion.
            The galaxy, now stable, is ruled by these two powers. The Imperium secures its domains through unyielding military might, while the Necrons impose a rigid, unchanging control. 
            While their empires remain separate, both ensure no other power can rise to challenge them.
            Peace, forged through domination, reigns across the stars, though it is a peace of absolute control and cold order.
