    <Element Type="Comment" Id="EED39EFF">
        <Comment>
            &lt;s val=&quot;AB_Description&quot;&gt;
            The galaxy died in silence. Not all at once, but piece by piece--its defenders carved apart by Hive Fleet Kraken&apos;s swift, surgical strikes, then buried beneath the creeping tide of Jormungandr. 
            One flanked, the other encircled. None escaped.
            The Imperium of Man was overrun. The Necron dynasties, though tireless, could not halt the relentless advance beneath their worlds. 
            The Tau Empire vanished into the dark, their technology and firepower proving useless against a foe that struck faster than thought and tunneled deeper than sensors could reach. 
            Chaos raged loudest--but in the end, its gods were left starving, denied fear, denied worship, denied prey. 
            Even Leviathan, the Hive Mind&apos;s once-prized spearhead, fell--its role made obsolete by a more precise, more patient form of extinction.
            Together, Kraken and Jormungandr perfected the hunt. Rapid isolation. Systematic ruin. Total consumption.
            Now, the stars are quiet. The biomass of a million worlds churns within the digestion pools of the Hive Fleets. 
            There are no more wars. No more resistance. No more names.
            Only instinct. Only silence. Only hunger.
            &lt;/s&gt;
        </Comment>
        <SubFunctionType Type="SubFuncType" Library="Ntve" Id="00000004"/>
